# Plan File Location

All plan files MUST live in the repository's `plans/` directory, never in `~/.cursor/plans/`.

## Rule

- Plans MUST be at: `<workspace_root>/plans/<plan_name>.plan.md`
- NEVER leave plans at: `~/.cursor/plans/`

## Why

- Plans should be version-controlled with the repository
- Team members can share and review plans
- Plans stay with the project they belong to

## Mandatory Procedure

The `CreatePlan` tool writes to `~/.cursor/plans/` by default and does not support custom paths. Therefore, IMMEDIATELY after every `CreatePlan` call:

1. Read the created file from `~/.cursor/plans/<filename>.plan.md`
2. Write its contents to `<workspace_root>/plans/<filename>.plan.md`
3. Delete the file from `~/.cursor/plans/<filename>.plan.md`

This is NOT optional. Every plan must be moved in the same turn it is created. Do not wait for the user to ask.
